## The vendored scanner

`crates/yamluna-scanner` is a fork of `saphyr-parser` 0.0.12 and carries its own
copyright holders under the same dual licence. Redistributing it means carrying
their licences too: they are in `crates/yamluna-scanner/LICENSE` and
`crates/yamluna-scanner/.licenses/`, and every change made to the fork is logged
in `crates/yamluna-scanner/FORK.md`.
